# {{displayName}}

VENTIX OS plugin scaffolded by `ventix create plugin`.

## Develop

From the workspace root:

```bash
pnpm ventix dev --plugin {{id}}
```

Then open `http://localhost:4200`. Edit `src/main.js` and the plugin
hot-redeploys; reload the shell to see changes.

## Manifest

Defined in `ventix.plugin.json`. Conforms to RFC-0001.
Run `pnpm ventix validate` to check the manifest.

## Build for production

```bash
pnpm ventix build --plugin {{id}}
```
